        "message": [
          "%md",
          "## 2. Visualize the one-hop and two-hop investigation path",
          "",
          "The next paragraph returns vertex and edge identifiers for the same seed account so Graph Studio can draw the network.",
          "",
          "**What to look for:** Dense connections around the seed account reveal shared infrastructure or payment relationships that are difficult to explain from transaction rows alone.",
          "",
          "Click **Run**. If Graph Studio displays a table, select the graph visualization for the paragraph."
        ],
