          "taskStatus": "SUCCESS",
          "status": "SUCCESS",
          "results": [
            {
              "message": "<h2>2. Visualize the one-hop and two-hop investigation path</h2><p>The next paragraph returns vertex and edge identifiers for the same seed account so Graph Studio can draw the network.</p><p><strong>What to look for:</strong> Dense connections around the seed account reveal shared infrastructure or payment relationships that are difficult to explain from transaction rows alone.</p><p>Click <strong>Run</strong>. If Graph Studio displays a table, select the graph visualization for the paragraph.</p>",
              "type": "HTML"
            }
          ]
        },
