        "message": [
          "%md",
          "## 4. Visualize the shared-entity fraud pattern",
          "",
          "The final query returns both accounts, the shared entity, and both relationship identifiers so Graph Studio can draw the complete pattern.",
          "",
          "**What to look for:** A device, IP address, phone, or email in the middle connects the two account nodes. Repeated shared identifiers can support a coordinated-fraud escalation.",
          "",
          "Click **Run**, inspect the graph, and select a node to review its properties."
        ],
